# Multi-Signature Timelock Script (P2SH Redeem Script)
# This script requires multiple signatures AND a timelock
# Useful for escrow or joint custody scenarios

# Redeem Script:
<locktime> OP_CHECKLOCKTIMEVERIFY OP_DROP <m> <pubkey1> <pubkey2> ... <pubkeyn> <n> OP_CHECKMULTISIG

# To spend, scriptSig must be:
# 0 <signature1> <signature2> ... <signaturem> <redeem_script>

# Example: 2-of-3 multisig with timelock until September 10, 2025
# Locktime: 1757462400
# Requires 2 signatures from 3 possible keys
1757462400 OP_CHECKLOCKTIMEVERIFY OP_DROP 2 0279be667ef9dcbbac55a06295ce870b07029bfcdb2dce28d959f2815b16f81798 03f9308a019258c31049344f85f89d5229b531c845836f99b08601f113bce036f9388 03c6047f9441ed7d6d3045406e95c07cd85c778e4b8cef3ca7abac09b95c709ee5 3 OP_CHECKMULTISIG